   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PST202 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.3</span>\n<h2>The 7 course learning outcomes (CLO), verbatim</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Exam questions are written against these outcomes — use them as your checklist.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 13365 · Decision 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 22/08/2025 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">PST202 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.3</span>\n<h2>7 chuẩn đầu ra môn học (CLO), nguyên văn</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Đề thi được ra theo các chuẩn đầu ra này — dùng chúng làm danh sách tự kiểm.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 13365 · QĐ 932/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 22/08/2025 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>CLO</th><th>Details (verbatim)<br><small>Nội dung (nguyên văn)</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>CLO1</strong></td><td>Understand the basic rules, concept of perspective</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>CLO2</strong></td><td>Understand How we see for perspective drawing and Why appearance differs from reality theory, concept of Picture plane, Cone of Vision. Understand concept of Vanishing points and eyes level, how to find vanishing point, eyes level on the picture plane, vanishing point of specical lines.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>CLO3</strong></td><td>Classify types of perspective: One point perspective, two point perspective, three point perspective. Know about concept and application of four, five, six, perspective. Understand and be able to draw one, two, three points perspective of objects with the determined size</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>CLO4</strong></td><td>Apply AI tools to generate references and suggestions for perspective drawings, while ensuring originality and accuracy. Having a positive attitude and a professional working style</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>CLO5</strong></td><td>Classify shade and shadow.Be able to draw shade and shadow of objects with sunlight source and Local point Sources of light to draw pictures.</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>CLO6</strong></td><td>Understand concept of Reflection. Be able to draw water, mirror reflections of perspective drawing</td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>CLO7</strong></td><td>Understand Method of perspective sketching , such as:<br>- Draw perspective of objects from simple shape.<br>-How to determine heights, depths and widths of objects in perspective<br>-Use Diagonals to divide to equal spacing and determine the center point of objects<br>-Dividing a Surface into Unequal Space and Equal Space by using a measuring line and special vanishing point.<br>Apply perspective drawing methods to draw sketches.</td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13365\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13365</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13365\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=13365</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
